主题/行业 → 从零构建报告框架\n- 自动应用金字塔原理、MECE原则\n- 生成分析框架 + 关键洞察 + PPT故事线\n- 智能需求澄清：根据输入量级决定是追问还是直接输出", "description_zh": "面向战略咨询、行业研究、投资分析与管理层汇报场景，将零散材料、会议纪要、访谈记录、数据摘录或单一研究主题，系统转化为具备咨询表达规范的结构化商业报告。该 Skill 采用自上而下的假设驱动分析方法，自动识别问题类型并匹配市场规模、竞争分析、市场进入、Turnaround、TMT / 新技术分析等常用咨询框架，输出结论先行、逻辑互斥穷尽、数据支撑明确、管理启示清晰的专业交付物。", "downloads": 26, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_40b4bb09/mbb-draft-distiller", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/c5e5faab-b8e1-489d-a489-8b56ffc52c07.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "MBB 咨询报告蒸馏器", "ownerName": "user_40b4bb09", "score": 1083.7849103793246, "slug": "mbb-draft-distiller", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780116815004, "version": "2.1.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779593219306, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 26, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/speech-memorization", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/81015f94-5620-494e-bbd6-ac3268e7ccd3.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "演讲稿记忆", "ownerName": "user_70c2f807", "score": 1076.158940397351, "slug": "speech-memorization", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780116814749, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779550568724, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 26, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/pet-health-manager", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "宠物健康管理", "ownerName": "user_70c2f807", "score": 841.9689119170985, "slug": "pet-health-manager", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780116814714, "version": "1.0.2"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779588705467, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 26, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/api-doc-speed-reader", "i